{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-template-js","path":"/Web/React/key_props/","result":{"data":{"cur":{"id":"6dd172f8-ddb1-5794-8bfd-f5471dbaf058","html":"<h1 id=\"key-props\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#key-props\" aria-label=\"key props permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Key Props</h1>\n<br>\n<p>→ <strong>Key는 React가 어떤 항목을 변경, 추가 또는 삭제할지 식별하는 것을 도움</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>리액트 요소를 고유하게 식별하는 데 사용</li>\n<li>key 값은 문자열 또는 숫자</li>\n<li>동일한 리스트나 배열 내에서 고유해야 함</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"사용법\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"사용법 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>사용법</h2>\n<p>⇒ key 값을 부여하지 않으면 error 발생  </p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 4.444444444444445%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAABQAAAABCAYAAADeko4lAAAACXBIWXMAABYlAAAWJQFJUiTwAAAARUlEQVR42mNwFBX+bycs+N+Sn++/jZDgf1Nenv+2QNqCn/e/IRcnkOb7b87HCxazERKAyvEB1XH/dxAR/m8pwAcWg6kBACw3Guo3vNGYAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"key prop warning console\"\n        title=\"key prop warning console\"\n        src=\"/static/54333f4f4527b9843c2e30655c811c2e/37523/key_prop_warning.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/54333f4f4527b9843c2e30655c811c2e/e9ff0/key_prop_warning.png 180w,\n/static/54333f4f4527b9843c2e30655c811c2e/f21e7/key_prop_warning.png 360w,\n/static/54333f4f4527b9843c2e30655c811c2e/37523/key_prop_warning.png 720w,\n/static/54333f4f4527b9843c2e30655c811c2e/58213/key_prop_warning.png 902w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> items <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> id<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'Apple'</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> id<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'Banana'</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> id<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'Cherry'</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> id<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">4</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> name<span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">'Date'</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>ul</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token plain-text\">\n\t</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>items<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">map</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">item</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span>li</span> <span class=\"token attr-name\">key</span><span class=\"token script language-javascript\"><span class=\"token script-punctuation punctuation\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>item<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>id<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>item<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>li</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token plain-text\">\n</span><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token tag\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;/</span>ul</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span></code></pre></div>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"필요성\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%95%84%EC%9A%94%EC%84%B1\" aria-label=\"필요성 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>필요성</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>성능 최적화</strong> : 변경된 부분만 업데이트하고 불필요한 렌더링 방지</li>\n<li><strong>유일성 보장</strong> : key는 각 항목을 고유하게 식별</li>\n</ul>\n<p>→ key를 제대로 사용하지 않으면 예기치 않은 버그 또는 성능 문제 초래</p>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://velog.io/@jenny87879/React-key-props\">https://velog.io/@jenny87879/React-key-props</a></p>","excerpt":"Key Props → Key는 React가 어떤 항목을 변경, 추가 또는 삭제할지 식별하는 것을 도움 리액트 요소를 고유하게 식별하는 데 사용 key 값은 문자열 또는 숫자 동일한 리스트나 배열 내에서 고유해야 함  사용법 ⇒ key 값을 부여하지 않으면 error 발생       필요성 성능 최적화 : 변경된 부분만 업데이트하고 불필요한 렌더링 방지 유일성 보장 : key는 각 항목을 고유하게 식별 → key를 제대로 사용하지 않으면 예기치 않은 버그 또는 성능 문제 초래  references 👉 https://velog.io/@jenny87879/React-key-props","frontmatter":{"date":"October 19, 2023","title":"[Web] React - Key Props","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/React/key_props/"}},"next":{"id":"299d9c1c-3d8c-513c-a8be-7aa2fc3fdaee","html":"<h1 id=\"test-driven-developmenttdd\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#test-driven-developmenttdd\" aria-label=\"test driven developmenttdd permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Test Driven Development(TDD)</h1>\n<br>\n<p><strong>→ 반복 테스트를 이용한 소프트웨어 방법론</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>코드 작성 전 작은 단위의 테스트 케이스 작성</li>\n<li>작성한 테스트 케이스를 통과시키는 코드 작성</li>\n<li>짧은 개발 주기 반복하는 개발 프로세스</li>\n<li>단순한 설계 중요</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"개발-절차\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B0%9C%EB%B0%9C-%EC%A0%88%EC%B0%A8\" aria-label=\"개발 절차 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>개발 절차</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 268px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 70%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"TDD 절차\"\n        title=\"TDD 절차\"\n        src=\"/static/3d79a7aeeb18f9a3eb38ecf87c32d9f3/484ae/TDD.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/3d79a7aeeb18f9a3eb38ecf87c32d9f3/e9ff0/TDD.png 180w,\n/static/3d79a7aeeb18f9a3eb38ecf87c32d9f3/484ae/TDD.png 268w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 268px) 100vw, 268px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code class=\"language-text\">Write Failing Test</code></strong> - 실패하는 테스트 코드 작성</li>\n<li><strong><code class=\"language-text\">Make Test Pass</code></strong> - 테스트 코드를 성공하기 위한 실제 코드 작성</li>\n<li><strong><code class=\"language-text\">Refactor</code></strong> - 리팩토링 수행</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"장점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9E%A5%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"장점 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>장점</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>코드 품질 향상 및 코드 정확성 보장</li>\n<li>초기 오류 감소 및 디버깅 시간 단축</li>\n<li>기능 단위 테스트로 빠른 피드백 가능</li>\n<li>코드 사용법 문서화</li>\n<li>안전한 리팩토링 제공</li>\n<li>추가 기능 구현 용이</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"단점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%8B%A8%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"단점 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>단점</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>초기에 테스트 작성으로 인해 많은 시간 소모 (생산성 저하)</li>\n<li>특정 요구사항의 경우 테스트 케이스 작성 어려움</li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"date":"October 17, 2023","title":"[CS] 소프트웨어엔지니어링 - Test Driven Development(TDD)","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/SoftwareEngineering/TDD/"}},"prev":{"id":"3bbcf261-a577-587d-bde9-7c75b3f77765","html":"<h1 id=\"메모이제이션-memoization\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%A9%94%EB%AA%A8%EC%9D%B4%EC%A0%9C%EC%9D%B4%EC%85%98-memoization\" aria-label=\"메모이제이션 memoization permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>메모이제이션 (Memoization)</h1>\n<br>\n<p>→ 연산의 계산 결과를 메모리에 저장해두고, 동일한 계산이 필요할 때 이전에 저장한 값을 재사용하는 기법</p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"usememo\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#usememo\" aria-label=\"usememo permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>useMemo</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>컴포넌트 내부에서 계산된 값</strong> 메모이제이션</li>\n<li>이전 계산 값 재사용</li>\n<li>계산 비용이 높은 연산 결과 캐싱하는 데 유용</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"usecallback\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#usecallback\" aria-label=\"usecallback permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>useCallback</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>함수</strong>를 메모이제이션</li>\n<li>불필요한 렌더링 방지</li>\n<li>이벤트 핸들러 함수나 콜백 함수 메모이제이션 할 때 사용</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"reactmemo\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#reactmemo\" aria-label=\"reactmemo permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>React.memo</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>컴포넌트 자체</strong>를 메모이제이션</li>\n<li>이전 렌더링 결과 재사용</li>\n<li>컴포넌트 중복 렌더링 방지</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"필요성\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%95%84%EC%9A%94%EC%84%B1\" aria-label=\"필요성 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>필요성</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>복잡한 연산 수행 시 결과를 재사용함으로써 불필요한 자원 소모 줄임</li>\n<li>동일한 계산 반복 수행 방지로 코드 실행 속도 향상</li>\n<li>동일한 입력값에 대해 동일한 결과 반환으로 일관성 제공</li>\n<li>중복 렌더링 방지 ⇒ 성능 향상</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://velog.io/@hsk10271/TIL-30\">https://velog.io/@hsk10271/TIL-30</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"October 19, 2023","title":"[Web] React - 메모이제이션","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/React/memoization/"}},"site":{"siteMetadata":{"siteUrl":"https://www.jsh99.com","comments":{"utterances":{"repo":"JSH99/JSH99.github.io"}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/Web/React/key_props/","nextSlug":"/CS/SoftwareEngineering/TDD/","prevSlug":"/Web/React/memoization/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1073350324","2938748437"]}